      "has_client_data": false,
      "has_smi": false,
      "readme_excerpt": "# Auto ticket merger This app merges tickets that were raised by the same customer within a configured window of time into the first ticket raised by the customer during the same window. It merges these tickets by 1. Adding a private note to the first ticket with the contents of the second ticket. 2. Adding a private note to the second ticket stating that its been merged with first ticket. 3. Closing the second ticket. It needs the following installation parameters. 1. Freshdesk API Key - needed to make the api calls to add notes and close tickets. 2. Time Window - The time window in minutes within which all tickets will be merged to the first ticket. 3. Include Emails - set of comma separated emails of customers whose tickets will always be merged irrespective of the Time Window configuration. 4. Exclude Emails - set of comma separated emails of customers whose tickets will never be merged irrespective of the Time Window configuration. 5. Include Domains - set of comma separated domains of customers whose tickets will always be merged irrespective of the Time Window configuration. 6. Exclude Domains - set of comma separated domains of customers whose tickets will never be merg"
    }
